# Export allowlist of the shared libanira on Mach-O (ld64 -exported_symbols_list).
# Same pattern set as cmake/anira.map — Mach-O symbol names carry a leading
# underscore; the rationale lives there. cmake/CheckExports.cmake verifies the
# result in CTest. Keep the three in sync.
__ZN5anira*
__ZNK5anira*
__ZTVN5anira*
__ZTIN5anira*
__ZTSN5anira*
__ZTTN5anira*
__ZTh*_N5anira*
__ZTv*_N5anira*
__ZGVN5anira*
